member.summary:
The only abstraction over the database, and the only type in the solution allowed to construct a SqlConnection.
Every call is a stored procedure. There is no method that accepts SQL text, by design: if a query is needed, a procedure is added to db/scripts/.
@CompanyID and @UserID are appended from ICurrentUser, never from a caller argument, so a repository cannot accidentally accept a tenant id from the request.
